<head><title>Verify YubiKey · Dreego Auth</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><script src="/_dreego/plugin-auth.js" defer></script><script src="/hardware-flow.js" defer></script></head>
<body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to YubiKey login</a>
    <main id="main" class="task-page">
        <p class="eyebrow">Step 8 of 8</p><h1>Sign in with your YubiKey</h1>
        <p class="task-lead">In the browser prompt choose Security key and touch the same YubiKey. The page also checks the protected server route.</p>
        <section class="panel"><button type="button" id="webauthn-login">Sign in with YubiKey</button></section>
        <section id="task-status" class="task-status" role="status" aria-live="assertive" tabindex="-1"><h2 id="status-title">Not verified yet</h2><p id="status-detail">Select Sign in with YubiKey and complete the security-key prompt.</p></section>
        <a id="next-step" class="primary-link" href="/" hidden>Hardware test complete — return to demo</a>
    </main>
</body>
